<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss Jan trade shows deficit of 686.7 mln Sfrs.</title>
<headline>Swiss Jan trade shows deficit of 686.7 mln Sfrs.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Switzerland's trade balance showed a deficit in January of 686.7 million Swiss francs, compared with a surplus of 187.2 million in December, the Federal Customs Office said.  </p>
<p>			  Jan 1997	Dec 1996	Jan 1996</p>
<p> Balance  (million Sfr) -686.7	  187.2	   -264.0</p>
<p> Imports  (million Sfr) 8,315.0	 7,390.6	 7,756.2</p>
<p> Exports  (million Sfr) 7,628.3	 7,577.8	 7,492.2</p>
<p>These figures do not include precious metals, precious stones, art objects and antiques. -- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
